omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o7Chof5Q9RQQ7kNvwElF-KD&_nc_oc=AdrbtJCrSl894ISnttsWrTUEO1MB_HQtv_L9PzTx1ShwqE9hglhe1BnmIrpmpIt2GWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7GmmTRiTISZlqcWY_LSdUFW0GL0Jr48V3Kbf5-qvVg_A&oe=6A1317B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rt_YiKdsL60Q7kNvwFO5zMP&_nc_oc=AdpjZwhgUPkCk3bFWQhWeYz8RP8PMgb4LeJZkatNKm7KtbQXCRxMqcAJ9EVv__Ka2n0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6scRFLHzvU_V2iXrmo4_Yf4M5AzaVtyMUvpgIQD0cORw&oe=6A131916"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3xL4rK9rnwwQ7kNvwHXrdko&_nc_oc=Adr1OV4ULX6AGh4413Gi8OPx0nIhzQkfIq39_NmqQQ48nOyP347mjxtgMjoNTMXC-Qw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6WITrANvGdfwQCFtSZ77bwfgQk_oIQaGqa5GfYVTRbIA&oe=6A12F5F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://